{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-93","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-rogue-93"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-93-talk-403816650-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-93","missionId":"event-rogue-93","mission":"배양판","scene":"배양판","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「이봐! 여기가 어디야? 왜 내 머릿속에서 이렇게 많은 사람이 논쟁을 벌이고 있지?」 질문을 던지는 동시에 깊은 분노가 끓어오른다. 당신은 모든 것을 파괴하고 찢어버리고 싶다","talkId":403816650,"textHash":"10856650417037117316","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:93/talk-403816650","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"78746193a32310f6","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-93-talk-403816651-line"],"bwikiPage":"培养皿","bwikiRevision":95895,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14337","bwikiMission":"배양판"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-93-talk-403816651-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-93","missionId":"event-rogue-93","mission":"배양판","scene":"배양판","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 지금 의식 한 줄기, 완벽한 학자의 의식 한 줄기이다. 귓가에 지식학회 학자들의 논쟁이 끝없이 맴돈다. 미래, 혼돈, 진화, 언어. 그들의 중얼거림이 들리지만, 그것들은 아무 의미가 없다","talkId":403816651,"textHash":"7609029979047065480","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:93/talk-403816651","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"78746193a32310f6","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-93-talk-403816652-line"],"bwikiPage":"培养皿","bwikiRevision":95895,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14337","bwikiMission":"배양판"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-93-talk-403816652-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-93","missionId":"event-rogue-93","mission":"배양판","scene":"배양판","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"학회에서 역대 가장 우수한 학자들을 데이터로 추출해 유일한 모형으로 응집시킨다. 그들이 예측하는 최고의 결과는 지식학회 최초의 완벽한 학자가 탄생하는 것이다","talkId":403816652,"textHash":"9971085413110551149","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:93/talk-403816652","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"78746193a32310f6","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-93-talk-403816653-line"],"bwikiPage":"培养皿","bwikiRevision":95895,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14337","bwikiMission":"배양판"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-93-talk-403816653-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-93","missionId":"event-rogue-93","mission":"배양판","scene":"배양판","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"수석 학사가 실험을 가동하자, 새로운 전류가 의식 속에서 솟구친다","talkId":403816653,"textHash":"3449858978568165900","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:93/talk-403816653","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"78746193a32310f6","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"培养皿","bwikiRevision":95895,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14337","bwikiMission":"배양판"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-93-talk-403816664-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-93","missionId":"event-rogue-93","mission":"배양판","scene":"배양판","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그러므로 고려해야 할 문제가 하나 있다","talkId":403816664,"textHash":"11288995060688722739","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:93/talk-403816664","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"d73e4aa956efb841","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-93-talk-403816665-line"],"bwikiPage":"培养皿","bwikiRevision":95895,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14337","bwikiMission":"배양판"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-93-talk-403816665-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-93","missionId":"event-rogue-93","mission":"배양판","scene":"배양판","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「자아의 의미를 찾는 것, 저는 이것이 인간이 되는 과정을 반복하는 것이라고 봅니다」 학사는 사람들에게 눈앞의 전자 배양판을 보여준다","talkId":403816665,"textHash":"15408781486517005909","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:93/talk-403816665","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"d73e4aa956efb841","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"培养皿","bwikiRevision":95895,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-pa